   "text": "markout horizon 60s \u00b7 epoch 60s \u00b7 reference selection window 3600s \u00b7 observation lifetime 7200s \u00b7 recommendation lifetime 3600s\ntrailing window 16 \u00b7 minimum trailing 16 \u00b7 dead band k=1\u03c3 \u00b7 persistence 3 of 5 \u00b7 alpha 0.25 \u00b7 target count 4\nfee 5.00 bps baseline, 100.00 bps ceiling \u00b7 gain 450,000 pips \u00b7 confidence floor 0.5 \u00b7 rate limit +500 / \u2212100 pips",
   "originalText": "markout horizon 60s \u00b7 epoch 60s \u00b7 reference selection window 3600s \u00b7 observation lifetime 7200s \u00b7 recommendation lifetime 3600s\ntrailing window 16 \u00b7 minimum trailing 16 \u00b7 dead band k=1\u03c3 \u00b7 persistence 3 of 5 \u00b7 alpha 0.25 \u00b7 target count 4\nfee 5.00 bps baseline, 100.00 bps ceiling \u00b7 gain 450,000 pips \u00b7 confidence floor 0.5 \u00b7 rate limit +500 / \u2212100 pips",
