   "text": "The dispatch is wrapped in try/catch. If Circle is\nunavailable the hook emits ObservationTransportFailed\nand returns normally. A completed swap is NEVER\nreverted because the learning path was down.",
   "originalText": "The dispatch is wrapped in try/catch. If Circle is\nunavailable the hook emits ObservationTransportFailed\nand returns normally. A completed swap is NEVER\nreverted because the learning path was down.",
