   "text": "Missing \u00b7 paused \u00b7 replayed \u00b7 wrong pool \u00b7 not yet\nvalid \u00b7 expired \u00b7 below the confidence floor. Seven\ndifferent failures, one answer. The pool is never\nleft guessing.",
