   "text": "Full-precision mulDiv up / down / signed, mulWadDown, abs,\nchecked casts. Unsigned division rounds down, signed rounds\ntoward zero \u2014 every Solidity formula and every golden vector\nshares that one convention.",
   "originalText": "Full-precision mulDiv up / down / signed, mulWadDown, abs,\nchecked casts. Unsigned division rounds down, signed rounds\ntoward zero \u2014 every Solidity formula and every golden vector\nshares that one convention.",
