   "text": "A sequenced, expiring, bounded recommendation: one fee and one\nrisk figure PER SIDE, plus a confidence. Never an instruction \u2014 a\nclaim the controller is free to reject.",
   "originalText": "A sequenced, expiring, bounded recommendation: one fee and one\nrisk figure PER SIDE, plus a confidence. Never an instruction \u2014 a\nclaim the controller is free to reject.",
