   "updated": 1788400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "local message transmitter \u00b7 source domain \u00b7 one-time-sealed processor peer \u00b7 finalized\nthreshold \u00b7 the right pool \u00b7 monotonic sequence (no replay) \u00b7 validAfter not in the future \u00b7\nvalidUntil not passed \u00b7 cooldown elapsed \u00b7 confidence \u2265 floor \u00b7 fee inside [5.00 bps, 100.00\nbps] \u00b7 risk inside bounds",
   "originalText": "local message transmitter \u00b7 source domain \u00b7 one-time-sealed processor peer \u00b7 finalized\nthreshold \u00b7 the right pool \u00b7 monotonic sequence (no replay) \u00b7 validAfter not in the future \u00b7\nvalidUntil not passed \u00b7 cooldown elapsed \u00b7 confidence \u2265 floor \u00b7 fee inside [5.00 bps, 100.00\nbps] \u00b7 risk inside bounds",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
