   "updated": 1788400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Recommendations expire after 3600s. If Circle stops, if Reactive stops, if the keeper stops,\nif the processor is wrong \u2014 the premium decays away and the pool returns to baseline on its\nown. Nothing has to be noticed for the safe thing to happen.",
   "originalText": "Recommendations expire after 3600s. If Circle stops, if Reactive stops, if the keeper stops,\nif the processor is wrong \u2014 the premium decays away and the pool returns to baseline on its\nown. Nothing has to be noticed for the safe thing to happen.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
