   "updated": 1788400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Measured on 2026-08-29 09:15 UTC, from the block timestamps of the six transactions above \u2014 not from a\nstopwatch and not from a log. Two of those legs are Circle's finality-2000 transport, and they are 39m 23s\nof the total. Reactive's wake is 36s of it.",
   "originalText": "Measured on 2026-08-29 09:15 UTC, from the block timestamps of the six transactions above \u2014 not from a\nstopwatch and not from a log. Two of those legs are Circle's finality-2000 transport, and they are 39m 23s\nof the total. Reactive's wake is 36s of it.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
